<title>USA: IMM currency futures end mostly higher.</title>
<headline>IMM currency futures end mostly higher.</headline>
<text>
<p>Oct 21 - IMM currency futures ended mostly higher, with Dec marks and Swiss francs closing near the top of the day's ranges. Both contracts set the daily range early in the session. Activity dried up. Can dollars ended higher, shrugging off opening losses.</p>
